            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c2",
            "value": "The youth traveler flies Seattle\u2013Amsterdam\u2013Brussels on August 4-5, 2026, then transfers Brussels\u2013Geneva on August 10, 2026.",
