            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c3",
            "value": "The family flies Seattle\u2013London Heathrow\u2013Geneva on August 9-10, 2026. All four travelers, including the youth, return Milan Linate\u2013London Heathrow\u2013Seattle on August 25, 2026.",
