              "Trips/Europe 2026/Confirmed itinerary.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c4",
            "value": "Because the confirmed return departs Milan Linate rather than Milan Malpensa, the northern Italy finish remains feasible but should preserve a final night in Milan and remain compatible with Linate departure.",
